The '''raw short-finned eel''' is a Tier 5 raw fish found while training [[Dungeoneering]].

Raw short-finned eels can be caught with a [[Fly fishing rod (Dungeoneering)|fly fishing rod]] and [[Feather (Dungeoneering)|feathers]], giving 81 [[Fishing]] experience each at level 40 Fishing. Raw short-finned eels can also be bought from the [[Smuggler]].

